  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.80 - AM020 expression-bodied void-method fixer parity\n- Direct expression-bodied void methods expand into blocks before the missing nested map is appended\n- Semantic void return and direct arrow-expression ownership preserve executable configuration order\n- Non-void methods, local functions, deferred maps, and unstable receivers remain fixless; arrow and semicolon comments are retained",
